text I turn around and head back as I mutter under my breath.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text But then my legs stop.
text ...What would she do if I disappeared right now?
text @[Tomoya]
text (She'd probably go look for me...)
text I've gotten myself into a rather sticky situation here, haven't I...
text @[Tomoya]
text *Sigh*
text I feel irritated all of a sudden.
text Irritated at myself for getting into this mess in the first place.
text Nothing would've happened if I hadn't done anything...
text @[Tomoya]
text (Agh, dammit.)
text I shake my head to snap out of it.
text Yeah... I just have to do what she told me.
text I need to be as natural as possible.
text If I am, then everything will go off without a hitch.
text And if that's the case, I won't have to regret today.
text All that'll happen is I'll eat dinner at her house, then head home. Nothing more, nothing less.
text @[Tomoya]
text (That's what I'll do...)
