text @[Tomoya]
text So this is the place, huh?
text I see a bakery immediately across the street from the park.
text The billboard says "Furukawa Bread."
text @[Tomoya]
text (What a plain-looking store...)
text Its glass door is half-closed, but a brilliant light pours out from it like a knocked over soda without a cap.
text They seem to still be open.
text Even so, it feels hard to walk in. Do any customers other than regulars come here?
text If I was a someone looking to buy bread, I'd probably look elsewhere, even if it meant going farther down the road.
text But today, I'm here because Furukawa invited me. My only option is to go in.
