text What did I come all the way here for...?
text What'd I plan to do once I got here...?
text A feeling of nostalgia hits me like a truck.
text Nostalgia for a kindness I knew long, long ago.
text I... don't think I'd ever known something like that.
text And yet, despite how distant that memory is, it still feels so familiar. Like it happened only yesterday.
text But just a little earlier, I'd been watching on as something like that took place again right in front of me.
text When they treated me like a child... I returned to being a child...
text But all I did was feel annoyed by that.
